{"unit_id":"feely0208__dsh-content-trust#feature-1","repo":"feely0208/dsh-content-trust","commit":"584555de5005ede6fe7982e4393232dfcbc68afc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"外部内容信任边界的功能「外部内容进入 prompt」：扫描消息、提示词或内容拼接表达式与网页、文件、邮件等内容变量组合的模式。通过 CLI 对项目文件匹配并报告发现项。","source":"generated","evidence":["rules/01-raw-content-to-prompt.json:7-13"]}
