{"unit_id":"feely0208__dsh-content-trust#feature-4","repo":"feely0208/dsh-content-trust","commit":"584555de5005ede6fe7982e4393232dfcbc68afc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"外部内容信任边界的功能「浏览器凭证上下文」：匹配浏览器 cookie、存储状态或凭证配置与登录态、token 等变量的组合，报告可能把凭证放入 agent 浏览器上下文的代码。","source":"generated","evidence":["rules/04-browser-credential.json:7-21"]}
